        "description": "USN-5376-4 fixed a regression in Git. The update introduced a regression when specifying configuration includes due to additional restrictions. This update fixes the problem.  We apologize for the inconvenience.  Original advisory details:   \u4fde\u6668\u4e1c discovered that Git incorrectly handled certain repository paths  in platforms with multiple users support. An attacker could possibly use  this issue to run arbitrary commands.",
